#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0123 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "ADAPTED-FROM fda/FDA-SD2001/FDA-SD2001-valid-DM.cdt (verbatim). ACTARMCD at the 20-character boundary (row 2) is conformant; short and empty values never fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | PBO | Placebo
S1 | DM | 002 | PLACEBO-RUN-IN-ARM-A | Placebo run-in arm A
S1 | DM | 003 |  | Screen Failure
